  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/44aba8a3-43d4-48f3-9ead-52a031f9f4de-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 171px;\" /></p><p>If initial value of current is zero, then it will take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;time to reach the peak value, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;time period.</p><p>As we know,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>120</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>240</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>",
